  "description": "Blue Christmas Village Clipart Bundle, Blue and White Winter Village PNG, Snowy Christmas House Clipart, Holiday Village PNG\nCreate a magical winter wonderland with this beautiful Blue Christmas Village Clipart Bundle! 💙🏠❄️🎄\nThis elegant collection features charming snow-covered Christmas cottages, winter houses, festive village scenes, grand manor homes, castle-style buildings, churches, bridges, windmills and magical holiday architecture decorated in a sophisticated blue and white color palette.\nThe illustrations combine snowy rooftops, evergreen trees, winter berries, wreaths, blue floral details, glowing windows and festive Christmas decorations for a cozy and enchanting holiday village aesthetic. Some designs also feature Santa Claus, Christmas trees, gifts and other seasonal details.\nPerfect for creating elegant Christmas stationery, sublimation products, greeting cards, invitations, wall art, mugs, tumblers, stickers, scrapbooks and winter-themed décor.\n✨ Features\n22 PNG Clipart Designs\nHigh-Resolution PNG\nTransparent Background\n12 × 12 Inch\n300 DPI\nBlue & White Christmas Theme\nSnow-Covered Christmas Houses\nCozy Winter Cottages\nElegant Holiday Village Scenes\nBlue Floral Architecture\nChristmas Village Buildings\nWinter Manor Houses\nCastle-Style Christmas Buildings\nSnowy Church Designs\nWinter Bridge\nDecorative Windmill\nChristmas Tree Village Scenes\nSanta Claus Winter Scene\nEvergreen Trees\nSnowy Pine Trees\nChristmas Wreaths\nBlue Winter Berries\nFestive Holiday Details\nMagical Winter Wonderland Aesthetic\nDetailed Watercolor-Style Artwork\n🎁 Perfect For\nChristmas sublimation, mugs, tumblers, Christmas cards, holiday invitations, winter wedding stationery, Christmas village décor, printable wall art, stickers, scrapbooking, journals, planners, gift tags, greeting cards, holiday signs, home décor, personalized gifts, wrapping paper and other Christmas craft projects.",
